{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2019-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1548979200, "end_date": 1549583999, "month_true_total": 902, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:58:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "48833318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198391674266", "personaname": "Jumpshotz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198391674266/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 18786, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1961, "last_played": 1773004354, "avatar": "209be9f30b9dc7795ccf90e734d32fd2dad2f0c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice", "timestamp_created": 1549577826, "timestamp_updated": 1549577826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48831930", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972337101", "personaname": "Symon Black", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972337101/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 104206, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27310, "last_played": 1780887274, "avatar": "cfaf6917f47ca6122396f46e485a79a090f29fa0"}, "language": "english", "review": "As far as Free-to-Play games go, there are few as fun, honest, and fair as Warframe. Even with a massive cash shop and plenty of ways to spend money, it just FEELS different from the casino-like, soulless grist-mills you usually find in the genre.\n\nAnd speaking of feel, I've never played anything with movement and action as dynamic and action-movie like as this. Backflip over enemies and shotgun them in midair. Run across a wall, leap off into a slide, and cut your foe in half. Stalk like a tiger and ambush your prey, or shriek like a maniac and rampage in like a rabid honey badger, guns blazing. It's all good, and it's a ton of fun.\n\nContent updates are frequent, the devs are open and engaged with the fans, and while there is some grind, it's mostly a passive affair that happens while you play. You can even earn cash-shop currency in-game without spending a dime.\n\nYou are not going to find a better game for this 'price'. If you like Masamune-Shirow-meets-Crouching-Tiger cyborg space-ninja gun-fu action made in Canada, this is your jam.", "timestamp_created": 1549572381, "timestamp_updated": 1549572381, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48831707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198818372623", "personaname": "Doctor Stink", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lolers1M3/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 5202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 301, "last_played": 1705797635, "avatar": "e26f032b98aae2c2f227170d1ad52a423da826da"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ok...now this game is EPIC", "timestamp_created": 1549571683, "timestamp_updated": 1549571683, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48831424", "author": {"steamid": "76561198218235788", "personaname": "HPtheOWL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198218235788/", "num_gam